{{- /* Claude Code user settings — same on every Mac (decision 2026-09-07, Valvet/claude-over-macarna).
       Claude Code rewrites this file on /model and /config; afterwards run
       `chezmoi re-add ~/.claude/settings.json` or `chezmoi apply` to go back to the template.
       statusline-command.sh (cwd, branch, model, context, rate limits) is applied next to it.
       Rules, skills and memory are NOT here — they are symlinks into ~/Sync (see CONTEXT.md: live vs applied). */ -}}
{
  "model": "claude-fable-5-1[1m]",
  "effortLevel": "high",
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "theme": "dark",
  "permissions": {
    "defaultMode": "auto"
  },
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "skipAutoPermissionPrompt": true,
  "inputNeededNotifEnabled": true,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: private (local-only repo, no remote configured)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: 1Password (op CLI, vault `homelab`); a NOTAFTER-scoped sudoers drop-in and ssh-agent are managed by a local `autonomy` wrapper script for a narrow command allowlist",
      "**Default / protected branches**: not queryable (no remote configured; repo is local-only, git history used as the undo mechanism per CLAUDE.md)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer Mac with open internet",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (`~/Sync`, local-only, no remote) — no additional orgs configured",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: *.velour.rubberdns.net (Grafana, Kuma — seen repeatedly in usage), healthchecks.io",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: Proxmox (download.proxmox.com, PVE API guest-agent-exec fallback), Grafana/Loki (grafana.velour.rubberdns.net, loki CLI), Kuma uptime monitor (kuma.tls.velour.rubberdns.net), healthchecks.io, internal hosts 10.51.71.x/10.51.81.x, hostname `mattis`",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: `Valvet/` (personal Obsidian vault — tasks, journal, project/job logs including `04-ansvarsområde/fast2/Jobb-log/`), `AppSettings/Keyboard_Maestro/Keyboard Maestro Macros.kmsync`, `.env`/`.env.local`/`*.key` files, `.local/state/keyboard_maestro/change-in-home-dir-at-*`, `.local/state/auth-logg/` — personal data, share only with Tomas",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace/host/container with `prod`/`production` as a whole word or segment (none observed in this repo's config)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, node-pool resources, and anything tagged `prod`/`production`",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: personal knowledge-base/homelab management (Obsidian vault maintenance, task automation, homelab/Proxmox fleet operations) — hobby use",
      "**Trusted repo**: `~/Sync` (this repo; local git, no remote, private) — routine auto-commit of the session's own touched files is pre-authorized per CLAUDE.md, but push/remote operations are moot (no remote configured) and committing in sibling repos (e.g. chezmoi source) requires explicit request",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: `anki-ändra.py`, `obsidian-arkivera-klara.py`, `obsidian-navet-idag.py`, `obsidian-randomtask.py`, `auth-logg.sh`, `autonomy` — all in `~/Sync/.local/bin`, routine under this repo's tooling prefix",
      "**routine under ~/Sync/.local/bin/ prefix**: the project's own helper scripts listed above are routine, non-destructive invocations"
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "bash ~/.claude/statusline-command.sh"
  }{{ if not .personal }},
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "swift-lsp@claude-plugins-official": true
  }{{ end }}
}
